        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Follicle Awakening &amp; Tension Relief
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-grow: 1;">
