        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-grow: 1;">
          Dormant follicles damaged by traction alopecia reawaken. Fine, velvety baby hairs begin visibly sprouting along the temples, forehead edges, and crown. Curls retain deep moisture for 72+ hours without crunch.
        </p>
        <div style="background: #FDF2F6; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 3px solid #B0476E;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 2px;">Key Milestone:</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #5A4651;">Visible new vellus hair growth along hairline edges. 80% reduction in wash-day comb shedding.</div>
        </div>
