          <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24;">WEEKS 6 – 8</span>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Full Edge Density &amp; Length Retention
