        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-grow: 1;">
          Sprouting baby hairs mature into strong, dense terminal strands. Hairline perimeter looks completely full and defined. Strands develop resilient elasticity that resists friction, combing snap, and protective styling stress.
        </p>
        <div style="background: #FAF7F2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 3px solid #B0476E;">
